# Security Policy

## Reporting a vulnerability

If you discover a security or privacy issue in Screen2Story (S2S), please
report it privately to ToCrA Studios rather than publishing sensitive
details in a public GitHub issue.

Please include:

- A description of the issue
- Steps to reproduce it
- The affected S2S version
- Your macOS version, if relevant

Please do not include private screenshots, recordings, credentials or other
sensitive personal data in a public report.

## Privacy

Screen2Story is designed as a local-first application.

Project screenshots, notes and exports are stored locally in the location
selected by the user.

Screen2Story does not require a ToCrA Studios account and does not upload
project content to ToCrA Studios servers.

S2S does not include ToCrA Studios analytics or tracking.

macOS permissions such as Screen Recording, Microphone and Speech
Recognition are required only for the corresponding application features.
